## Install

Copy this directory into `modules/custom/{{ machine }}` and enable it:

```
drush en {{ machine }}
```

The tables are created from `hook_schema()` when the module is installed, and
dropped when it is uninstalled. Nothing here writes SQL: Drupal builds the
statements for whichever driver the site runs on.

